# MoE shapes for grouped GEMM, k_axis workload (backward wrt weights)
#
# Companions to the forward shapes in shapes_grouped_moe. For expert e the
# weight gradient is dW_e = X_e^T @ dY_e, contracted over the tokens routed to
# e, so the token count becomes the variable (k) axis:
#
#   forward   total_M x K : G x K x N   with per-expert token counts as M_g
#   backward  K x total_M : total_M x N with the same counts as K_g
#             -> dst is the dense weight-gradient stack [G, K, N]

# ── Llama4 Scout: M=5120, N=8192 (E=16 exact) ────────────
--grouped=1:16:balanced
5120x512:512x8192nLlama4-Scout-gate/up-proj-gs128-bwd
8192x512:512x5120nLlama4-Scout-down-proj-gs128-bwd

# ── Qwen2-57B-A14B: M=3584, N=2560 (E=64 exact) ──────────
--grouped=1:64:balanced
3584x2048:2048x2560nQwen2-57B-A14B-gate/up-proj-gs128-bwd
2560x2048:2048x3584nQwen2-57B-A14B-down-proj-gs128-bwd

# ── Qwen3-30B-A3B: M=2048, N=768 (E=128 exact) ───────────
--grouped=1:128:balanced
2048x2048:2048x768nQwen3-30B-A3B-gate/up-proj-gs128-bwd
768x2048:2048x2048nQwen3-30B-A3B-down-proj-gs128-bwd

# ── GPT-OSS-20b: M=2880, N=2880 (E=32) ──────────────────
--grouped=1:balanced
2880x1024:1024x2880nGPT-OSS-20b-gate/up-proj-bwd
2880x1024:1024x2880nGPT-OSS-20b-down-proj-bwd
